<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Eden shares debut at 9.80 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Eden shares debut at 9.80 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of restaurant operator Eden Enterprises (M) Bhd made their market debut at 9.80 ringgit against an offer price of 2.50.</p>
<p>The company offered 3.325 million new and 2.792 million vendor shares for its listing on the second board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
